[*] DD104 — a GTKWave save file for labs/cocotb-intro.
[*] Open it with:  gtkwave counter.fst counter.gtkw
[*] A .gtkw is just a list of which signals to show. GTKWave opens with an
[*] EMPTY wave pane by default; this file is how you stop re-adding them.
[dumpfile] "counter.fst"
[timestart] 0
[size] 1360 700
[signals_width] 200
[sst_width] 200
@28
counter.clk
counter.rst_n
counter.en
counter.load
@22
counter.d[7:0]
counter.q[7:0]
@28
counter.tc
[pattern_trace] 1
[pattern_trace] 0
